meta {
  name: Get Song Title
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/music/song-title
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  `GET /api/music/song-title`

  Demonstrates `CancellationToken` handling: the controller starts the DynamoDB
  load and then **immediately cancels it**. If the cancellation wins you get
  `400` with `ProblemDetails { type: "typeisfailed", detail: "Failed" }`; if the
  load completes first you get `200` with the song title.

  The outcome is a race, so no status assertion is set.
}
